					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">hehehe i need Bert and Saryrn for Ele access... but im flagged to qvic... bah oh well =/<br />if anyone does any open raiding PoP count me in.. specially if its those 2 kills =)&nbsp; 11k unbuffed 2100ac warr at yer service =)</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</b><br />
