					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Hello,<br />Eternalruby, officer of Radiant on Quellious here. <br />Just to clarify. We are in the Elementals at this time with a Fennin Ro kill (3rd I believe) and working on GoD and other Elemental gods. <br />Our message board is http://p199.ezboard.com/bradiance88931<br />I&#039;ve already spoken with fellow officers so perhaps one of them can clarify further if you want :D<br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
