					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">that is all he is, burn and kite,&nbsp; but there&#039;s alot of encounters like that... back in the day when the keeper was &#039;cutting edge content&#039; it was often give or take weather or not we&#039;d finish ikk4 within a few hours and farm other stuff, or wipe multiple times on the keeper just due to bad luck... and christ we farmed that motherfucker for months... was horrible...</div>
